  ],
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      "The ",
      { "id": "rio", "es": "río", "en": "river" },
      " is there before the ",
      { "id": "sol", "es": "sol", "en": "sun" },
      " is high. It is wide, as the ",
      { "id": "cacique", "es": "cacique", "en": "chief" },
      " said with his hands, and the ",
      { "id": "corriente", "es": "corriente", "en": "current" },
      " moves whole trees down the middle of it. Brown ",
      { "id": "agua", "es": "agua", "en": "water" },
      ", deep. The ",
      { "id": "guia", "es": "guías", "en": "guides" },
      " stop. The people of the ",
      { "id": "cacique", "es": "cacique", "en": "chief" },
      " stop. Three hundred ",
      { "id": "hombre", "es": "hombres", "en": "men" },
      " stand on the bank and look at the far side, and nobody has started cutting ",
      { "id": "pino", "es": "pinos", "en": "pines" },
      " for ",
      { "id": "balsa", "es": "balsas", "en": "rafts" },
      "."
    ],
    [
      "Juan Velázquez does not wait. He is a ",
      { "id": "hombre", "es": "hombre", "en": "man" },
      " from Cuéllar, a horseman, tired of walking his ",
      { "id": "caballo", "es": "caballo", "en": "horse" },
      " through ",
      { "id": "arena", "es": "arena", "en": "sand" },
      ". He rides into the ",
      { "id": "rio", "es": "río", "en": "river" },
      ". The ",
      { "id": "corriente", "es": "corriente", "en": "current" },
      " takes them at the middle. For one ",
      { "id": "momento", "es": "momento", "en": "moment" },
      " I see him hold the reins, pulling the head of the ",
      { "id": "caballo", "es": "caballo", "en": "horse" },
      " around, and then the ",
      { "id": "agua", "es": "agua", "en": "water" },
      " turns them both over and closes. It is fast. The ",
      { "id": "muerte", "es": "muerte", "en": "death" },
      " of a ",
      { "id": "hombre", "es": "hombre", "en": "man" },
      " can be as fast as that."
    ],
    [
      "In the evening the people of the ",
      { "id": "cacique", "es": "cacique", "en": "chief" },
      " find the ",
      { "id": "caballo", "es": "caballo", "en": "horse" },
      " far down the ",
      { "id": "rio", "es": "río", "en": "river" },
      ", against the bank, and they show us where the ",
      { "id": "cuerpo", "es": "cuerpo", "en": "body" },
      " is. We take the ",
      { "id": "cuerpo", "es": "cuerpo", "en": "body" },
      " out of the ",
      { "id": "agua", "es": "agua", "en": "water" },
      " and I write his name in my book. He is the first. The ",
      { "id": "mar", "es": "mar", "en": "sea" },
      " and the ",
      { "id": "tormenta", "es": "tormenta", "en": "storm" },
      " have taken many since Sanlúcar, but on this march no ",
      { "id": "hombre", "es": "hombre", "en": "man" },
      " had died until this ",
      { "id": "momento", "es": "momento", "en": "moment" },
      "."
    ],
    [
      "That night we eat the ",
      { "id": "caballo", "es": "caballo", "en": "horse" },
      ". Nobody says much. ",
      { "id": "hambre", "es": "Hambre", "en": "Hunger" },
      " does not mourn, and the meat feeds many ",
      { "id": "hombre", "es": "hombres", "en": "men" },
      " who have had little ",
      { "id": "comida", "es": "comida", "en": "food" },
      " but ",
      { "id": "maiz", "es": "maíz", "en": "corn" },
      ". The ",
      { "id": "flauta", "es": "flautas", "en": "flutes" },
      " of the ",
      { "id": "cacique", "es": "cacique", "en": "chief" },
      " do not play. There is a ",
      { "id": "silencio", "es": "silencio", "en": "silence" },
      " over both camps, and under the ",
      { "id": "silencio", "es": "silencio", "en": "silence" },
      " the ",
      { "id": "corriente", "es": "corriente", "en": "current" },
      " keeps its one sound. I put the numbers in my book. ",
      { "id": "hombre", "es": "Hombres", "en": "Men" },
      ", three hundred less one. ",
      { "id": "caballo", "es": "Caballos", "en": "Horses" },
      ", forty-two less one."
    ],
    [
      "In the morning we cross, slowly, with care, and no one else is lost. On the far side there are ",
      { "id": "campo", "es": "campos", "en": "fields" },
      " again, and houses, and the ",
      { "id": "cacique", "es": "cacique", "en": "chief" },
      " points ",
      { "id": "norte", "es": "norte", "en": "north" },
      " with his open hand. Apalachee. His ",
      { "id": "enemigo", "es": "enemigos", "en": "enemies" },
      ", our ",
      { "id": "oro", "es": "oro", "en": "gold" },
      ". Every ",
      { "id": "hombre", "es": "hombre", "en": "man" },
      " in the column walks a little faster now. I walk at the back, where I can count, and I think about the ",
      { "id": "corriente", "es": "corriente", "en": "current" },
      ", which did not care what we were looking for."
    ]
  ],
